R {1}{0}{<238>}{Gloomrest Town Square (s,e,w,n,ne,se,sw,nw)}{<238>[ ]<088>}{This is the center of Gloomrest, a small town nestled in the heart of a vast swamp. The air is thick with mist and the scent of decay. The ground is muddy and uneven, with puddles of stagnant water scattered about. The buildings around the square are old and weathered, their wooden facades rotting and covered in moss. A few hardy souls can be seen going about their business, but most of the town seems to be abandoned. The only sounds are the croaking of frogs and the occasional splash of something moving in the water. }{Gloomrest}{cot}{townsquare}{}{1.000}{}
