R {13}{0}{<108>}{Entrance to the Catacombs (sw,d)}{<108>[v]<088>}{The ground before you is covered with immacutely maintained grass, split in the middle by a black stone path leading to a towering wall of stone on the far side. Set into the a wall of age-darkened stone stands a pair  of massive double doors, their surfaces are covered in intricate carvings showing imagery from the founding of Gloomrest, ships braving storm-lashed seas, the raising of the cathedral's spires, and solemn processions of priests and mourners guiding the honored dead below. Weather and time have softened some details, yet the craftsmanship remains striking, each figure and symbol framed by curling gothic motifs and runic inscriptions. Through the opened doorway stone steps lead downward, illuminated by burning lanterns set into nooks on the walls. }{Gloomrest}{}{crypt_entrance}{}{1.000}{}
E {11}{sw}{sw}{12}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}
E {14}{d}{d}{32}{0}{}{1.000}{}{0.00}

